{"id":"n26761-1-7","stage":2,"title":"위층 · 楼上","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26761-1-7-1","ko":"위층으로 올라가는 계단이 너무 더러워졌어요.","zh":"上楼的楼梯太脏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"위층으로","meaning":"楼上","explanation":"위층：楼上；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"위층","audio":"/audio/1cbb7c370249b92c2e6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26761","senseId":"1","lemma":"위층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라가는","meaning":"上，登上，爬上","explanation":"올라가다：上，登上，爬上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"15","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계단이","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더러워졌어요.","meaning":"脏，污浊；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"더럽다：脏，污浊；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"더럽다","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47384","senseId":"1","lemma":"더럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1cbb7c370249b92c","term":"위층","zh":"楼上","audio":"/audio/1cbb7c370249b92c2e6f.mp3","entryId":"26761","definition":"位于某层上面的楼层。","pronunciation":["위층"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，登上，爬上","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"走向高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"af422da88e6c5a06","term":"더럽다","zh":"脏，污浊","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3","entryId":"47384","definition":"沾有污渍或渣滓而脏污不干净。","pronunciation":["더ː럽따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8360676947949d48c87f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26761-1-7-2","ko":"가서 청소를 해야겠네요.","zh":"得去打扫一下了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청소를","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야겠네요.","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"8049e4b9139d36bf","term":"청소","zh":"打扫，清扫，扫除","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3","entryId":"32789","definition":"清除肮脏杂乱的东西。","pronunciation":["청소"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aa9b694b57588f7a1562.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.118,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26761","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8433,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["得去打扫一下了。","打扰一下，小卖部在哪儿呢？","上楼的楼梯太脏了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["得去打扫一下了。","上楼的楼梯太脏了。","打扰一下，小卖部在哪儿呢？"],"answer":0}]}
